text = "EXECUTE
Once you've read the instruction you can execute it. The manual explains what each instruction does. Simply do what the manual says and you're done!

HALTING
Once you encounter a HALT instruction, press the big red button to end the program. If you executed the program correctly, you can move on to the next program!"
